      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "There is no escape from the silence Elias has already built, because the very act of trying to find one proves you are still trapped in the loop. Pretending there is a way out only makes the emptiness louder, as if you are fighting a ghost that is already inside your bones. The exhaustion isn't a lack of hope; it is the final realization that the only thing keeping him alive is the memory of what he used to love, and now that memory is the only thing left.",
